<title>USA: Wall St stocks open slightly lower, IBM rises.</title>
<headline>Wall St stocks open slightly lower, IBM rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened slightly lower on Wednesday, but IBM clmbed up to a point after it was named stock of the week by a brokerage firm.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were off 4 points to to 5885 and the NASDAQ Index was down 3 points to 1200.</p>
